-- Welcome.cm -- what you can do on this Dorado.Echo ---- Xerox Dorado, Cedar 6.1 ----Echo Type one of these, or click the buttons in this window's menu line:Echo Browse.cm - list the files on this disk (click a name, then Open)Echo Schematic.cm - the Dorado's OWN processor board drawingEcho Moon.cm - a 1978 photograph of the moon, halftonedEcho Ifu.cm - the Instruction Fetch Unit board drawingEcho Memo.cm - Ed Taft's 1980 Dorado Booting memo, in TiogaEcho Images.cm - list every picture on this machineEcho Color.cm - turn on colour and load Gargoyle's packagesEcho Gargoyle.cm - turn on colour, load Gargoyle, and open itEcho Welcome.cm - print this againEcho Pictures take a while. The Imager is doing real 1985 halftone work.